<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - Unilever H1 guilder profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Unilever H1 guilder profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997.</p>
<p>(in billions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per share (guilders)		32.83  vs  6.22</p>
<p>    Net profit/constant exchange rates   8.56  vs  1.77</p>
<p>    Ditto excl chemicals sale profit     2.21  vs  ----</p>
<p>    Net profit/current exchange rates    9.21  vs  1.75</p>
<p>    Ditto excl chemicals sale profit     2.38  vs  ----</p>
<p>    Turnover				    44.05  vs  42.73</p>
<p>    Operating profit			   3.86  vs  3.22</p>
<p>    Operating profit before exceptionals 4.05  vs  3.50</p>
<p>    Interest charges (millions)	     282  vs  346</p>
<p>    Tax					    1.30  vs  1.06</p>
<p>    Tax on chemicals sale profits	  1.50  vs  nil</p>
<p>NOTE -- Unilever NV/PLC was expected by analysts to produce first  half net profit from normal operations of between 1.93 and 2.27 billion  guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
